# Galion, Elvenking's Butler, a 4/4: "Whenever Galion attacks, choose up to one other target creature you control. Its base power and
# toughness become equal to Galion's power and toughness until end of turn." On turn 3 Galion attacks and the trigger targets the
# Ornithopter (Galion himself and the opponent's Ornithopter are refused): a 4/4 until end of turn (base set, CR 613.4b). Giant
# Growth then makes Galion 7/7 but not the Ornithopter (the values were fixed as the ability resolved, the ruling), and it is a
# 0/2 again on turn 4. On turn 5 Galion attacks again and no target is chosen ("up to one"): the Ornithopter stays 0/2.

